[00:12.82] I feel your racing heart
[00:17.52] My liquid silver arms extended
[00:23.88] These waves aren't far apart
[00:29.79] Black gold in claw foot tubs unchanging
[00:36.30] I am fire, where's my form?
[00:43.03] Whisper crimson I intrude
[00:48.76] There's light beneath your eyes
[00:55.06] New overtones in view
[00:59.09] Endless form, endless time
[01:06.92] If what they say is true
[01:10.48] You are a shadow in the fourth dimension
[01:20.08] To float away with you
[01:23.66] We see the corners where nothing happens
[01:30.73] While we drifted we were one
[01:36.03] Ceilings lifted walls were gone
[01:40.74] You speak the language of the breeze
[01:45.27] All your leaves were meant for me
[01:48.65] The love that every person wants to be
[02:22.29] Stuck together, I don't like revealing secrets
[02:27.48] I'll live inside your lips if you won't laugh
[02:33.14] My heaving hands on rotten fruit at last
[02:37.26] Fallow fingers, there's a surface I can count on
[02:42.60] She'd fit inside my heart and take it over
[02:46.87] Till her cape got blown into my red lungs
[02:51.38] Either there's a purpose
[02:53.31] Or I'm heading out at breakfast
[02:57.87] Take a drink, take a drag
[03:00.00] One more coffee, ugly hat
[03:01.85] No more mirrors, woolen bag
[03:05.84] And I am gone
[03:19.65] 